-- One constructed teacher, run through the root step by step (the client,
-- 2026-11-14: "compute each step rather than argue it, and keep it as a
-- test with a trace"). She teaches in post-primary education under Oz
-- LaTmura; she is employed by the State and is a member of ארגון המורים;
-- her youngest child turns 14 on 1 September, and she turns 55 the same
-- day.
--
-- Each step asks the root's public answer (`the answer that governs`)
-- where a pay item of the shared vocabulary covers the claim. Where none
-- does, it says so and asks the module's own rule, or the precedence
-- module's, directly: no answer below is the root's unless it came from
-- the root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `root`
IMPORT `1995-09-12_oz-latmura_special-agreement-hashlama`
IMPORT `1998-09-08_oz-latmura_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`
IMPORT `2023-24_tashpad_01`
IMPORT `2025-26_tashpo_01`
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-11`
IMPORT `oz-founding-21`
IMPORT `oz-founding-48`
IMPORT `takanon-1-13`
IMPORT `terms`

§ `מקרה קצה: מורה אחת דרך השורש`

§§ `1 תוספת 2008 בדצמבר 2009`

-- Covered by a pay item: `the 2008 public-sector supplement`. The teacher
-- in December 2009 — the month the agreement of 24.1.2008 raises the
-- supplement to 5% and the 17.6.2009 deferral holds it at 3%. Her combined
-- salary in December 2007 is 10,000 and her 2001 supplement 300, so 5% is
-- 515 and 3% is 309. `organised` says whether ארגון המורים represents her;
-- a Histadrut member is the same teacher with it FALSE. Both are in a
-- population the ministry put off (the deferral's §2 reaches every State
-- teacher). In December 2009 Oz LaTmura (14.8.2011) had not been signed:
-- what makes her "an Oz teacher" then is her organisation, and the
-- agreement of 24.1.2008 is registered in the Oz LaTmura family's root.
GIVEN organised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `teaching case`
DECIDE `the edge teacher in December 2009` organised IS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`           IS TRUE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS organised
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS TRUE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 300
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `heads the junior division`       IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS FALSE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 0
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 0
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

`the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים` MEANS `the edge teacher in December 2009` TRUE
`the edge teacher, of the Histadrut` MEANS `the edge teacher in December 2009` FALSE

-- What a ruling says, in one line: the instrument that governs, the rule,
-- and the answer.
DECLARE `the ruling in short` HAS
    `governs`  IS A STRING
    `rule`     IS A STRING
    `amount`   IS A NUMBER

GIVEN r IS A MAYBE `ruling`
GIVETH A MAYBE `the ruling in short`
DECIDE `in short` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST g THEN JUST (`the ruling in short` WITH
                               `governs` IS g's `governed by`'s `title`
                               `rule`    IS g's `by the rule`
                               `amount`  IS g's `the answer`)

-- The claims, instrument by instrument, as the root collects them.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `who speaks on the 2008 supplement for` c IS
    map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `by`'s `title`) (`the claims on` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` c)

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `what each says of the 2008 supplement for` c IS
    map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `answer`) (`the claims on` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` c)

-- The two side by side: the organisation's member, then the Histadrut's.
#EVAL `who speaks on the 2008 supplement for` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים`
#EVAL `what each says of the 2008 supplement for` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים`
#EVAL `in short` (`the ruling on the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים`)
#EVAL `who speaks on the 2008 supplement for` `the edge teacher, of the Histadrut`
#EVAL `what each says of the 2008 supplement for` `the edge teacher, of the Histadrut`
#EVAL `in short` (`the ruling on the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of the Histadrut`)
#EVALTRACE `the answer that governs` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים`

-- What the root computed. Four instruments speak for the organisation's
-- member: the takanon §1.1 (300: its 3%, on the combined salary alone),
-- 24.1.2008 (515), 21.2.2008 (515) and the deferral of 17.6.2009 (309).
-- §19 drops 21.2.2008, the deferral being a later agreement of the same
-- parties; §23 weighs 24.1.2008 against the deferral, of other parties,
-- and 515 is in her favour; the takanon is out by its introduction. The
-- Histadrut's member is not reached by 24.1.2008: three speak, §19 leaves
-- the deferral, and the takanon is out — 309, by the rule the root names
-- for an agreement as amended.
`the organisation's member gets 5% by §23` MEANS
    `in short` (`the ruling on the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים`)
        EQUALS JUST (`the ruling in short` WITH
                         `governs` IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 24.1.2008"
                         `rule`    IS `§23: the provision in the employee's favour`
                         `amount`  IS 515)

`the Histadrut's member gets 3% by §19` MEANS
    `in short` (`the ruling on the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of the Histadrut`)
        EQUALS JUST (`the ruling in short` WITH
                         `governs` IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 17.6.2009 (הסתדרות המורים)"
                         `rule`    IS `the takanon's introduction: an agreement, as amended, prevails`
                         `amount`  IS 309)

#ASSERT `the answer that governs` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of ארגון המורים` EQUALS JUST 515
#ASSERT `the organisation's member gets 5% by §23`
#ASSERT `the answer that governs` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `the edge teacher, of the Histadrut` EQUALS JUST 309
#ASSERT `the Histadrut's member gets 3% by §19`

§§ `2 תוספת האם לילד בן 14 בדיוק`

-- No pay item covers the mother's supplement (the card mother-child-
-- fourteen says so: not_in_root = no-pay-item), so the root cannot be
-- asked. Each instrument's own rule is asked instead, and the precedence
-- between them is the takanon's introduction (`prevails over the takanon`,
-- l4/takanon/terms-service.education.gov.il/terms.l4), which is the rule
-- precedence.l4 itself applies first.
--
-- The school year opens on 1 September; her youngest child turns 14 that
-- day, so on 1 September the child's age in whole years is 14.
`the child's age on 1 September` MEANS 14
`her position` MEANS 0.85

-- The agreement of 12.9.1995 (ארגון המורים), §י: the position the
-- mother's supplement is paid on. "עד גיל 14" includes a child of 14
-- (convention thresholds.until-time, MMS-689). Her 85% is all teaching;
-- §י speaks of mothers "in teaching and in guidance posts", and the rule
-- reads her position in both together.
`the 1995 agreement pays her supplement on` MEANS
    `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on`
        `the child's age on 1 September` `her position` `her position` FALSE

-- The takanon, §1.13: a child counts while under 14, or where it turned 14
-- AFTER 1 September (§1.13.2, the exception convention thresholds.until-time
-- records). Turning 14 ON 1 September is neither.
`the edge teacher's youngest child` MEANS
    `child` WITH
        `relation to the employee`        IS `own child`
        `age on 1 September`              IS `the child's age on 1 September`
        `age now`                         IS `the child's age on 1 September`
        `age when taken into foster care` IS 0
        `months in foster care`           IS 0

`the edge teacher's year, for §1.13` MEANS
    `mother-teacher year` WITH
        `is a woman teaching employee or instructor` IS TRUE
        `has custody of his children under a divorce agreement or judgment` IS FALSE
        `is married now` IS TRUE
        `is a foster parent approved by the Welfare Minister's delegate` IS FALSE
        `children`                     IS LIST `the edge teacher's youngest child`
        `the other parent is also a teaching employee` IS FALSE
        `the couple chose this parent` IS FALSE
        `hours with each owner`        IS LIST `her hours with the State`
        `works at the employer's demand` IS TRUE
        `asked by the Ministry to work beyond a position` IS FALSE
        `is a coordinating kindergarten teacher required to work a full position` IS FALSE
        `full-position combined salary` IS 10000

`her hours with the State` MEANS
    `hours with an owner` WITH
        `teaching share`            IS `her position`
        `guidance share`            IS 0
        `education-hours share`     IS 0
        `year-long auxiliary share` IS 0
        `single auxiliary share`    IS 0
        `study-grant share`         IS 0

-- Which governs where the two do not match: the takanon's introduction lets
-- a collective agreement prevail whatever its date, so the date §1.13 was
-- last amended (an input there) cannot change the answer; both ends of the
-- range are asked.
`the 1995 agreement, against the takanon` MEANS
    `conflicting source` WITH
        `source kind`   IS `a collective agreement`
        `source issued` IS DATE_FROM_DMY 12 9 1995

-- Under Oz LaTmura, §11(ז) replaces the earlier agreements' "תוספת אם" for
-- mothers under the reform, and §11(ג) keeps their definition of a mother
-- teacher — the 1995 one, which takes her in at 14. A mother who keeps the
-- week she would have had is paid on a position 7 points larger (§11(ב)).
`under Oz, she is paid on` MEANS `the position a mother keeping her week is paid on` `her position`

#EVAL `the 1995 agreement pays her supplement on`
#EVAL `is a child up to 14 this year` `the edge teacher's youngest child`
#EVAL `is a mother-teacher` `the edge teacher's year, for §1.13`
#EVAL `mother supplement` `the edge teacher's year, for §1.13`
#EVAL `prevails over the takanon` `the 1995 agreement, against the takanon` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1900)
#EVAL `prevails over the takanon` `the 1995 agreement, against the takanon` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2100)
#EVAL `section 11 replaces the earlier mother-hours provisions` TRUE
#EVAL `under Oz, she is paid on`
#EVALTRACE `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` `the child's age on 1 September` `her position` `her position` FALSE
#EVALTRACE `mother supplement` `the edge teacher's year, for §1.13`

#ASSERT `the 1995 agreement pays her supplement on` EQUALS `her position`
#ASSERT NOT `is a mother-teacher` `the edge teacher's year, for §1.13`
#ASSERT `mother supplement` `the edge teacher's year, for §1.13` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `prevails over the takanon` `the 1995 agreement, against the takanon` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1900)
#ASSERT `prevails over the takanon` `the 1995 agreement, against the takanon` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2100)
#ASSERT `section 11 replaces the earlier mother-hours provisions` TRUE
#ASSERT `under Oz, she is paid on` EQUALS 0.92

§§ `3 עוז §48 ביום הולדתה ה־55`

-- No pay item: §48 is a permission, asked of its own module. "עד הגיעו
-- לגיל 55" includes the birthday (convention thresholds.until-time). The
-- permission waits on an amendment of the training fund's regulations,
-- which the corpus does not record: it is the module's input, asked both
-- ways.
#EVAL `section 48 lets the teacher join the regular track` TRUE 55
#EVAL `section 48 lets the teacher join the regular track` FALSE 55
#EVAL `joining the regular track` TRUE 55

#ASSERT `section 48 lets the teacher join the regular track` TRUE 55
#ASSERT NOT `section 48 lets the teacher join the regular track` FALSE 55

§§ `4 טיול שמסתיים בדיוק ב־15:00`

-- No pay item: asked of each trip table's own module. Her own table, as a
-- teacher under Oz LaTmura in full from תשע"ב, is §21(א), which counts from
-- 16:00. The organisation's table of 8.9.1998, which §21(א) replaced for
-- her, gives 15:00 to the row that opens at it (thresholds.shared-bound).
-- The owners' circulars' table (תשפ"ו/1 §16.2, as תשפ"ד/1 §15.2 and the
-- years between print it: the Ofek Hadash reform's, not hers) opens a row
-- at 15:00 worth half a unit.
#EVAL `section 21 governs the reward for activity in` `the school year 5772` `the Oz reform in full`
#EVAL `the units an activity earns` (`an activity ending at` 15)
#EVAL `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 15)
#EVAL `trip units` (`ending at an hour` 15)

#ASSERT `the units an activity earns` (`an activity ending at` 15) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 15) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `trip units` (`ending at an hour` 15) EQUALS 0.5

§§ `5 תא בטבלה שחוזר מדפיס, גבוה מזה של ההסכם`

-- Covered in part. The root answers the agreement's cell (`the combined
-- salary of a full position`, from the Ofek Hadash tables), but no
-- circular in the root claims a combined salary: the grid the owners'
-- circulars print (תשפ"ד/1 annex ד') is a picture, and the corpus publishes
-- no cell of it as text, so the L4 holds none. The circular's cell is
-- therefore this test's input — 6 more than the agreement's, the size
-- MMS-479 reports at grade 6.5, seniority 1 — and the ruling between the
-- two is asked of precedence.l4's `the ruling between the collections`,
-- the function the root itself folds with, not of the root. The teacher of
-- this test is an owner's teacher of the Ofek Hadash reform: the circular
-- is addressed to the owners, and speaks to no State teacher of Oz.
GIVEN employer IS A `the teacher's employer`
GIVETH A `teaching case`
DECIDE `a reform teacher at grade 6.5, seniority 1, on 1.9.2023` employer IS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023
        `employer`                        IS employer
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 0
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 0
        `the kind of school`              IS `a recognised unofficial special-education school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `heads the junior division`       IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS TRUE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 1
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 6.5
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

`the excess the circular prints` MEANS 6

GIVEN employer IS A `the teacher's employer`
GIVETH A LIST OF `ruling`
DECIDE `the agreement's cell and the circular's` employer IS
    CONSIDER `the ruling on the item` `the combined salary of a full position` (`a reform teacher at grade 6.5, seniority 1, on 1.9.2023` employer)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN EMPTY
    WHEN JUST a THEN
        LIST a,
             `ruling` WITH
                 `the answer`  IS a's `the answer` PLUS `the excess the circular prints`
                 `governed by` IS `circular תשפ"ד/1`
                 `by the rule` IS `the only instrument that speaks`

GIVEN employer IS A `the teacher's employer`
GIVETH A MAYBE `ruling`
DECIDE `the cell that governs` employer IS
    `the ruling between the collections` (`the agreement's cell and the circular's` employer) employer (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1900)

#EVAL `in short` (`the ruling on the item` `the combined salary of a full position` (`a reform teacher at grade 6.5, seniority 1, on 1.9.2023` `employed by another owning body`))
#EVAL `in short` (`the cell that governs` `employed by another owning body`)
#EVAL `in short` (`the cell that governs` `employed by a local authority`)
#EVAL `in short` (`the cell that governs` `employed by the State`)

-- For an owner and for a local authority, §29 voids the excess and the
-- agreement's cell governs, as convention precedence.reprinted-table says.
-- For the State as employer §29 binds nothing (it binds budgeted and
-- supported bodies), so §22 lets the circular's higher cell stand, as
-- convention precedence.reprinted-table-state says (a pick for the lawyer,
-- MMS-758; l4/tests/root-tests.l4 holds the same three answers). The
-- circular is addressed to the owners, so the State row is a case no
-- circular of the root makes; it is held here as what precedence answers.
GIVEN employer IS A `the teacher's employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement's cell governs for` employer IF
    CONSIDER `the cell that governs` employer
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST g THEN
            g's `governed by`'s `kind` EQUALS `a collective agreement`
        AND g's `by the rule` EQUALS `§29: the excess over the agreement is void`

#ASSERT `the agreement's cell governs for` `employed by another owning body`
#ASSERT `the agreement's cell governs for` `employed by a local authority`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement's cell governs for` `employed by the State`
